    Wire office locations to the API and capture coordinates
    
    Locations were hardcoded in the frontend: adding one only mutated React
    state and vanished on refresh. Now backed by /organizations/locations
    with create, update, activate/deactivate and delete.
    
    Adds latitude/longitude fields, which the API stores and the geofence
    needs — the old form collected a "city" the API has no column for, and no
    coordinates at all, so a location could never actually fence anything. An
    active location without coordinates is now refused, and existing ones are
    flagged "No geofence" in the list.
    
    Verified against production: create/update/persist/delete all confirmed.
